  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>∵</mo></math> required plane is passing through point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />and parallel to vector <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Therefore, the equation of plane is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
